"Each map asset declares quest spawns {questName, ownedIndexes, mustSpawnCount, canSpawnCount, sideRoomBias}. ONE quest links across MANY maps by partitioning its index space: each area owns a disjoint slice of the quest's bits. Push-time validation: no overlapping ownership of the same quest's indexes between maps, all indexes < bitCount. Multi-instance is safe by construction: duplicate physical cookies across instances share an index, and popcount caps the grant."